            <div xml:id="d230">

                <pb facs="0333" n="231" sameAs="frus:frus1933v03/pg231"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">793.94/6018: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in China (Johnson) to the Secretary of
                        State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peiping</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-03-11T11:00:00+08:00">March 11, 1933—11
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received March 11—1:53 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>239. Japanese Legation here announces officially that Hsifengkou and Kupeikou
                    passes were occupied by the Japanese on the 9th and 10th instant
                    respectively.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Johnson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
